        "blast_url": "https://blast.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/Blast.cgi?PAGE_TYPE=BlastSearch&PROG_DEF=blastn&BLAST_SPEC=GDH_GCA_905310635.1",
        "comments": "The assembly pEimTen1.1 is based on 41x PacBio data, 10X Genomics Chromium data, and Arima Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project (https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). PacBio subreads were assembled with Canu, contigs were deduplicated using Gap5, and the assembly was scaffolded with scaff10x using E. tenella 10x Chromium Illumina reads. This was then broken with break10x and re-scaffolded using SALSA2 and E. tenella Hi-C reads. Juicebox and Tigmint were used to break scaffolds. RaGOO was then used to re-scaffold, using another assembly generated from the same PacBio reads using wtdbg2. The assembly was then polished with Arrow and Pilon, using 10x Chromium Illumina reads. It then underwent manual curation before final polishing with Pilon. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in reverse order of size. Annnotation was initially generated using Companion, with Eimeria tenella strain Houghton as the reference, and the annotations were then manually curated by Uli Bohme.",
